    "name": "Section 10.3—Waiver of Claims",
    "text": "3, Without limiting the aforesaid, Licensee hereby waives any and all claims or rights or causes of action it has or in the future may have of any nature whatsoever, against Licensor, except for any breach or breaches of Licensor’s contractual obligations herein set forth. Licensee hereby waives all rights at law and equity to claim fraud, inaccuracy, imperfection of the System(s) herein claimed, or seek any consequences, damages or any form of redress with respect to said property."
