    "name": "Section 10.6(i)—Injunctive Orders",
    "text": "Notwithstanding anything contained herein: (i) the Licensee may not consent to any injunctive order or decree binding upon ARP without the consent of ARP, which consent shall not be unreasonably withheld or delayed;"
