    "name": "Section 11.1—Revocation and Reassignment",
    "text": "SECTION 11 —- MISCELLANEOUS I. Without limitation to any other provision hereof, if this Agreement is terminated upon Licensee’s default, or upon any other termination of this Agreement, it is hereby agreed that any rights herein set forth shall be deemed to be automatically revoked and automatically reassigned to Licensor,"
